{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09867","headline":"使院中新栽柏树子呈李十五栖筠 · 岑参","name":"使院中新栽柏树子呈李十五栖筠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱尔青青色，移根此地来。\n不曾台上种，留向碛中栽。\n脆叶欺门柳，狂花笑院梅。\n不须愁岁晚，霜露岂能摧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}